    measurement.json.material.minable_ideas.integration_work[1] = A browser voice agent integration that fetches its own enablement and public credential at runtime, refuses to initialise when unconfigured, probes and releases microphone permission before starting, tracks call lifecycle events, and degrades to a callback form.
